# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# ── Secrets: never commit ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Matches at any depth (root and node-backend/). Only the template is tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
id_rsa*
credentials*.json
service-account*.json
secrets/

# ── Dependencies (any folder, incl. node-backend/node_modules) ──────────────
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# ── Build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Logs & runtime files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
logs/
tmp/
uploads/

# ── OS & editor files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
